{"asset_key":"ep3/gameplay_story_13602050","episode":"ep3","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"13602050","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1360205001:0":{"text":"驱除了不知何时潜入镇子的魔物后，你们看向了前来助阵的身影……","source_cn":"驱除了不知何时潜入镇子的魔物后，你们看向了前来助阵的身影……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x515C6546FD1903F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1360205002:1":{"text":"诸位，久违了。\n这里应该暂时没有其他魔物了。","source_cn":"诸位，久违了。\\n这里应该暂时没有其他魔物了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8915015CD2395CDE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1360205003:1":{"text":"顿里尔大人！多亏您及时出手！","source_cn":"顿里尔大人！多亏您及时出手！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x402894236D2ED548","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1360205004:0":{"text":"我的声音也恢复正常了！刚刚突然就无法控制，真是吓我一大跳！","source_cn":"我的声音也恢复正常了！刚刚突然就无法控制，真是吓我一大跳！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7E54BF3E715944A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1360205005:0":{"text":"多谢您的帮助！这位……是半神大人吧？","source_cn":"多谢您的帮助！这位……是半神大人吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFEF778F576EF1E3B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","docu